# Local sales data safety

Sales Excel files stay on the owner’s machine. Treat path handling as a security boundary.

## Path gating

- Resolve user-supplied paths only via `resolveAllowedPath` / `MENUYUKTI_DATA_DIR`
- Reject traversal and paths outside the data dir (see `apps/menuyukti/src/lib/paths.ts`)
- Never open arbitrary absolute paths from tool arguments without that gate

```ts
// ❌ BAD — trust client path
readFileSync(userPath);

// ✅ GOOD — gate then read
const path = resolveAllowedPath(userPath);
readFileSync(path);
```

## Privacy

- Do not log full sales row contents, PII, or spreadsheet cell dumps at info/default levels
- Prefer paths relative to `MENUYUKTI_DATA_DIR` in tool results and logs
- Do not add network upload or remote storage of POS files
- Keep Skybridge telemetry opted out in run scripts (`DO_NOT_TRACK` / `SKYBRIDGE_TELEMETRY_DISABLED`)
- Auth/secrets (API keys) never belong in the repo or fixtures
